5. Data-Driven Pattern
This pattern separates the test data (e.g., login credentials) from the test scripts by storing data in external files like CSV, JSON, or Excel. 
•	Example: Using TestNG's @DataProvider to feed multiple sets of usernames and passwords into a single login test method.
